# This directory holds temporary encrypted file uploads at runtime
# (see backend/.env.example's FILE_STORAGE_PATH). Files written here
# are random-named ciphertext blobs, auto-deleted when their room
# expires or is destroyed — nothing here is meant to be committed.
#
# This .gitkeep file exists only so the empty directory itself is
# tracked by git; everything else placed here should stay out of
# version control (see the root .gitignore).
